{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tetris is an iconic puzzle game that has been enjoyed by gamers of all ages since its creation in 1984. In this game, players are presented with a series of blocks that fall from the top of the screen. These blocks come in different shapes and sizes, and it's the player's job to arrange them in a way that creates complete horizontal lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the game progresses, the blocks fall faster and in more complex shapes, requiring quick reflexes and strategic thinking. Players must constantly think ahead and plan their moves carefully in order to maximize their score and avoid losing. The game's simple mechanics make it easy to learn, but its endless possibilities make it challenging to master.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601620?t=1743314139","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601620?t=1743314139","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601620/f9fa964e02766062bdec0c066aff7e6a78ef14ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743314139","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601620/f9fa964e02766062bdec0c066aff7e6a78ef14ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743314139","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tetris is an iconic puzzle game that has been enjoyed by gamers of all ages since its creation in 1984. In this game, players are presented with a series of blocks that fall from the top of the screen. These blocks come in different shapes and sizes, and it's the player's job to arrange them in a way that creates complete horizontal lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the game progresses, the blocks fall faster and in more complex shapes, requiring quick reflexes and strategic thinking. Players must constantly think ahea